      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">2。能源差价合约交易如何运作？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6b71a5a6f08d3092",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Energy CFDs are traded based on the price difference between the opening and closing positions. Profit or loss depends on whether the market moves in the predicted direction.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/energy-cfd-trading-in-uae-with-upforex-trade-global-energy-markets-smarter#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/energy-cfd-trading-in-uae-with-upforex-trade-global-energy-markets-smarter"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">能源差价合约根据开仓和平仓之间的价差进行交易。盈利或亏损取决于市场是否朝着预测的方向发展。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tea8cd216d0b8a0de",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">3. Can Gas CFDs be traded at any time?</span></span>",
