        "SSR:/blogs/energy-cfd-trading-in-uae-with-upforex-trade-global-energy-markets-smarter"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">3。天然气差价合约可以随时交易吗？</span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9b89179807a6ccf2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">CFD trading involves significant risk Ensure you fully understand the risks involved before trading. Trade Smart!</span>",
