    {
      "key": "t2aefe5b129bedfa9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">But how does CFD trading work? Why is it considered part of OTC trading? And how can traders use these tools safely and strategically?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">但是差价合约交易是如何运作的呢？为什么它被视为场外交易的一部分？交易者如何安全且有策略地使用这些工具？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5fc00b9572403031",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">What Is a CFD?</span></span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">什么是差价合约？</span></span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t04a4f03e0159695e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A Contract for Difference is a financial derivative that lets traders speculate on the price movement of an underlying asset without actually owning it. The trader and broker exchange the difference between the opening and closing price of the contract.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">差价合约是一种金融衍生品，允许交易者在不实际拥有基础资产的情况下推测其价格变动。交易者和经纪商交换合约开盘价和收盘价之间的差价。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1342a58cdf71b550",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">According to CMC Markets, CFDs let traders trade on rising and falling markets by taking long or short positions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">根据 CMC Markets 的说法，差价合约允许交易者通过持有多头或空头头寸来在上涨和下跌的市场中进行交易。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t25e9980bd0da2eb1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">CFDs are also derivative instruments. As explained by Wikipedia, CFDs allow gain or loss based on price movement of an underlying instrument—such as stocks, indices, currencies, and commodities—without owning them.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">差价合约也是衍生工具。正如维基百科所解释的，差价合约允许基于基础工具（例如股票、指数、货币和商品）的价格变动而产生收益或损失，而无需拥有它们。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2b6d4abec9b5c786",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">Understanding CFD Index Trading</span></span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">了解差价合约指数交易</span></span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf01ae423c4f615fb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A CFD index is simply a CFD whose underlying asset is a market index—a basket of stocks that represents a segment of the economy or market.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">差价合约指数只是一种差价合约，其标的资产是市场指数——代表经济或市场一部分的一篮子股票。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2521371e6d96479a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">CMC Markets confirms that CFDs are commonly used for index trading because they allow exposure to broad market movements without buying any physical shares.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">CMC Markets 确认差价合约通常用于指数交易，因为它们允许在不购买任何实物股票的情况下接触广泛的市场波动。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t68849f702250258e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">This makes CFD trading ideal for traders who want:</span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">这使得差价合约交易成为想要以下功能的交易者的理想选择：</span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4c2b39480b77d5da",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Diversification</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">多元化</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0f3d72b1175c8c45",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lower volatility than single stocks</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">波动性低于单一股票</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb81f82794b0a61e9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Exposure to global markets</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">开拓全球市场</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7046bc827d9ad06e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Simple long/short positions</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">简单多头/空头头寸</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9f817c602cf92e0a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">What Is OTC Trading?</span></span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">什么是场外交易？</span></span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t208aabb14af13179",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Most CFD trades—including CFD index trades—are OTC instruments.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">大多数差价合约交易（包括差价合约指数交易）都是场外交易工具。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t907a0fa246d82fbc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This makes OTC index CFDs a convenient way to speculate on broad market movements with lower entry barriers—while still requiring strong risk management due to leverage and counterparty exposure.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">这使得场外指数差价合约成为一种以较低的进入门槛来推测广泛市场走势的便捷方式，同时由于杠杆和交易对手风险，仍然需要强有力的风险管理。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7724726a99439290",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is especially useful in CFD where price movements are smaller and more stable than individual stocks.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">这对于差价合约尤其有用，因为差价合约的价格变动比个股更小且更稳定。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7c595d33fc4ed8e9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">MoneySense confirms that CFDs allow trading in both directions to capture market opportunities.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">MoneySense 确认差价合约允许双向交易以捕捉市场机会。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3965f7843807f7ae",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">3. Access to Global Markets Instantly</span></span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">3。立即进入全球市场</span></span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t00ef9ec5f6ce4f23",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">4. No Physical Ownership or Settlement</span></span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">4。无实体所有权或结算</span></span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4ffa4a55c00f0d45",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Since CFDs don’t involve buying actual index units:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">由于差价合约不涉及购买实际指数单位：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tdf5b42b1305ef8f7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">No stock transfer</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">无需股票过户</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb3f42756cbbe0a2a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">No custody fees</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">无托管费</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1550cb9d7878ff4b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">As per Wikipedia, CFDs are purely price-speculation instruments.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">根据维基百科，差价合约纯粹是价格投机工具。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t95f93dff00b180f5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Index CFD's carries significant risks due to leverage, where losses can exceed your initial deposit. Because CFDs are OTC products, traders also face counterparty risk and limited price transparency.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">指数差价合约由于杠杆作用而带有重大风险，损失可能超过您的初始存款。由于差价合约是场外交易产品，交易者还面临交易对手风险和有限的价格透明度。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te294738b1a77b469",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">1. Leverage Risk</span></span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">1。杠杆风险</span></span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t10c272bb3b2ad917",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Leverage is a powerful tool in CFD index trading, but it comes with heightened risk. While it can significantly boost potential profits, it also magnifies losses just as quickly. According to MoneySense, losses in leveraged CFD positions can even exceed your initial margin if the market moves sharply against you. This makes disciplined risk management and position sizing absolutely essential for every trader.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">杠杆是差价合约指数交易中的强大工具，但它也伴随着较高的风险。虽然它可以显着增加潜在利润，但它也会同样迅速地放大损失。根据 MoneySense 的说法，如果市场走势对您不利，杠杆差价合约头寸的损失甚至可能超过您的初始保证金。这使得严格的风险管理和头寸规模调整对于每个交易者来说都至关重要。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2c651cc114ca4dbb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">2. Counterparty Risk</span></span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">2。交易对手风险</span></span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb97059c6699123ec",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Because CFDs are OTC instruments, traders depend on the broker to honor every contract. Saxo Bank identifies this counterparty risk as a key concern in CFD trading. Choosing a reputable and well-capitalized broker like UpForex is essential to ensure security and trust in every trade.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">由于差价合约是场外交易工具，交易者依赖经纪商履行每份合约。盛宝银行将这种交易对手风险视为差价合约交易中的一个关键问题。选择像 UpForex 这样信誉良好且资本充足的经纪商对于确保每笔交易的安全和信任至关重要。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td1aeb750524cec80",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">4. Margin Calls &amp; Overnight Costs</span></span></span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">4。追加保证金和隔夜费用</span></span></span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "taead414683e9ec68",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">CFDs incur financing charges for overnight positions, and margin calls can occur if equity falls below requirements.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/cfd-index-trading-and-otc-markets-explained-upforex"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">差价合约会产生隔夜头寸融资费用，如果净值低于要求，可能会发生追加保证金通知。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te27d483d36bf3bcf",
